# ── Migration artifacts: never commit real PII/credentials ─────────────────
# Real Firebase exports and generated migration manifests (they contain
# emails/UIDs) live OUTSIDE the repository — see docs/phase-3-auth-migration-plan.md.
# scripts/migration/build-manifest.mjs also refuses --out paths inside the repo.
exports/
manifests/
firebase-export*.json
firebase-export*.jsonl
*-manifest.jsonl

# ── Credentials (trusted local environment only) ───────────────────────────
service-account*.json
*service-account*.json
firebase-*credentials*.json
supabase-service-role*.json
supabase-*secret*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Generic tool noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.DS_Store
